IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BROWSER-AUDIT-PROD.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-STATUS           PIC X(10).
01  WS-FILE-NAME        PIC X(30) VALUE "results.csv".
01  WS-RECORD-COUNT     PIC 9(05) VALUE 0.
01  WS-ERR-MSG          PIC X(50).

FILE SECTION.
FD  AUDIT-FILE.
01  AUDIT-REC.
    05 REC-ID          PIC 9(05).
    05 REC-VAL         PIC X(50).
    05 REC-STAT        PIC X(01).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    OPEN INPUT AUDIT-FILE.
    IF SQLCODE NOT = 0
        DISPLAY "ERREUR: ACCES FICHIER IMPOSSIBLE"
        STOP RUN.

    DISPLAY "DEBUT DE L'AUDIT DE CONFORMITE...".

    PERFORM UNTIL SQLCODE = 100
        READ AUDIT-FILE
            AT END SET SQLCODE TO 100
            NOT AT END
                ADD 1 TO WS-RECORD-COUNT
                IF REC-STAT = 'E'
                    DISPLAY "ALERTE: RECORD " REC-ID " EST EXPOSE!"
                END-IF
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM.

    DISPLAY "---------------------------------".
    DISPLAY "AUDIT TERMINE.".
    DISPLAY "TOTAL RECORDS TRAITES: " WS-RECORD-COUNT.
    DISPLAY "---------------------------------".

    CLOSE AUDIT-FILE.
    STOP RUN.